sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Verity RAG API
    participant R as Retriever
    participant RR as Reranker
    participant L as LLM
    participant V as Verifier
    U->>API: Ask a question
    API->>API: Guards - rate limit, length, daily request limit
    API->>L: Rewrite query with a small model
    par Hybrid retrieval
        API->>R: Dense search, top 50
    and
        API->>R: Keyword search, top 50
    end
    R-->>API: Candidates
    API->>API: Reciprocal Rank Fusion
    API->>RR: Rerank fused top 50
    RR-->>API: Scored passages
    alt Gate 1 - top score or passage count below threshold
        API-->>U: No answer, plus the closest sections
    else Enough evidence
        API->>L: Grounded prompt with sources S1 to S8
        alt Gate 2 - the model replies NO_ANSWER
            L-->>API: NO_ANSWER
            API-->>U: No answer, plus the closest sections
        else The model answers
            L-->>API: Streamed answer with S-number citations
            API-->>U: Stream tokens
            API->>V: Check each sentence against its cited source
            V-->>API: Supported, partial or unsupported per sentence
            alt Gate 3 - more than 30 percent unsupported
                API-->>U: Replace the answer with no answer, plus the closest sections
            else 30 percent or fewer unsupported
                API-->>U: Final answer, each sentence marked supported or not
            end
        end
    end
